Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.85,0:01:58.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:00.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You like my star shield?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.56,0:02:01.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,What's up with this guy's body?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.97,0:02:04.80,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way a human\Ncould do this stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.04,0:02:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spitting fire again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.77,0:02:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Master Nails!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.74,0:02:11.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,75)}Moon Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.04,0:02:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop jumping around!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.65,0:02:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're getting nowhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.92,0:02:20.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was hoping my Four\NPowers would be enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I guess not.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.58,0:02:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I haven't mastered\Nthe Finger Pistol yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.59,0:02:25.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I've got a little stand-in
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.02,0:02:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that should do the\Njob quite nicely.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.36,0:02:29.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.29,0:02:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my chance to go to the next car!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.06,0:02:33.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, I thought we were\Nhaving a fight, here!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.43,0:02:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He thinks he's smart.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Beans Left!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:45.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice try.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.62,0:02:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I saw that coming\Nfrom a mile away!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.26,0:02:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.70,0:03:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.51,0:03:05.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You son of a bitch,\NOuchie Finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:07.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Shave!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.92,0:03:08.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ain't good.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.95,0:03:11.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got my number now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.34,0:03:14.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tempest Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.34,0:03:17.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just grazed me!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.01,0:03:18.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He sure moves\Naround a lot, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.81,0:03:22.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know your weak point!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.68,0:03:25.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's your back, isn't it?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.40,0:03:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that's not\Ncounting your brain,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.44,0:03:30.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,which is an obvious\Nweakness, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.54,0:03:33.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it's only a matter of time\Nbefore you're finished.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.68,0:03:35.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get ahead of yourself, pal.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.62,0:03:39.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a move that'll get\Nrid of my weak point easy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:39.62,0:03:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Franky Invincible!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.76,0:03:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat that!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.03,0:03:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now do you give\Nup, weasel face?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.92,0:03:52.55,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,That's so stupid, I don't even have a\Ncomeback.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.55,0:03:55.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is nothing but bad luck.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.89,0:03:57.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, bad luck for you, I mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.54,0:04:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did I mention I was super this week?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.18,0:04:05.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not a good time to make me angry.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.39,0:04:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you something, brother.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.52,0:04:10.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of the\Ncreature they call a "Centaur"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:12.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.37,0:04:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean those\Nthings that are human
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.07,0:04:16.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from the waist up and like\Na horse from the waist down?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.90,0:04:18.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what about them?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.38,0:04:24.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Convert!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.43,0:04:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.26,0:04:46.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.67,0:04:50.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Franky... Centaur Mode!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.74,0:04:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's backwards!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.94,0:04:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your head's supposed to be in the front,\Nnot your crotch!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.69,0:04:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You call this backwards?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.73,0:05:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just wait 'til I rearrange\Nyour face, weasel boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.18,0:05:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it you crook cook!\NDon't talk saucy to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.20,0:05:06.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My awesome noodle fists are all gone!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.70,0:05:07.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What am I?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.84,0:05:11.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An onion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:12.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're an onion,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.44,0:05:14.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're gonna make yourself\Ncry if you keep this up.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.71,0:05:16.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just quit while you're ahead.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.71,0:05:18.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't cry and I won't quit!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:18.81,0:05:21.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who said I was gonna lose?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.32,0:05:25.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm Wanze, CP7's ace!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.17,0:05:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I may look like I'm having fun,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.84,0:05:29.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but I take this\Nmission very seriously.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The government's been\Nchasing Robin for years
Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.08,0:05:32.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and I'm not gonna\Nbe the one to blow it
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.94,0:05:34.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,now that we finally have her!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.65,0:05:35.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So maybe you're the one
Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.78,0:05:37.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who should quit\Nwhile you're ahead!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.68,0:05:39.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now Ramen Kenpo!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.81,0:05:41.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Noodle Nail Knockout!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When cutting an onion,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.98,0:05:51.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you need to sever the stem
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.15,0:05:53.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the root without\Nharming the flesh.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.62,0:05:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you chop through the\Nfiber with one clean stroke
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:02.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the surface will\Nretain its glossy shine.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.03,0:06:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.17,0:06:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Epluchage!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.11,0:06:27.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You... You cut me!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.79,0:06:37.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? You didn't cut me?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.98,0:06:40.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure peeling onions\Nmay not be glamorous,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:44.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but you have to put love into\Nevery aspect of your cooking.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.59,0:06:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kitchen knives aren't for cutting people.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't treat them like swords.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.86,0:06:53.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, they did a fine job of cutting\Ndown that armor.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.03,0:06:54.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kitchen Knife Throw!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.60,0:06:57.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.90,0:07:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Œil!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.90,0:07:04.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My eyes! They're caving in!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.03,0:07:05.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let 'em.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.51,0:07:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, shut your\Nmouth and give up.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:11.12,0:07:13.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you wish!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.78,0:07:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.78,0:07:16.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to\Nsave that terrible woman
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.26,0:07:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so much in the first place?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.23,0:07:21.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or maybe Nico Robin's\Ngot you all fooled.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.33,0:07:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want me to tell\Nyou the truth, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.56,0:07:25.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think you can take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:26.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Nez!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:27.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Joue!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.35,0:07:28.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bouche!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.38,0:07:29.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Dents!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Menton!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.52,0:07:35.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you keep talking like that,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.69,0:07:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna re-arrange your face.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.69,0:07:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything but the face!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.83,0:07:44.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.88,0:07:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows she's bad news.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.45,0:07:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's no secret!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.85,0:07:51.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's evil!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.60,0:07:52.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.37,0:07:53.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Better off dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Parage Shot!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.70,0:08:17.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I think\Nmy face caved in!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.43,0:08:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need a mirror.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.12,0:08:31.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.49,0:08:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You fiend!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.59,0:08:36.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You ruined my beautiful eyes\Nand my fabulous teeth!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.42,0:08:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the devil, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.79,0:08:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, your face went back!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.79,0:08:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.43,0:08:46.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.13,0:08:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My inner beauty is shining!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.27,0:08:52.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was but a fleeting illusion.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're guilty of three sins.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me list them.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.22,0:09:00.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First off, you dared to call\Nyourself a chef in front of me.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.22,0:09:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Second, you were\Ndisrespectful to your food.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.98,0:09:08.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And third, you insulted my friend.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For that, you'll pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.26,0:09:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiss!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.43,0:09:23.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You put on a big show, but you're all bark\Nand no bite!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.37,0:09:27.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whether you've got\Ntwo legs or four,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you still seem pretty\Nuseless to me, centaur.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.22,0:09:41.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah! No!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.43,0:09:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lookin' pretty pathetic, buddy.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.20,0:09:51.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.47,0:09:54.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shall I give you a hand?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:57.34,0:09:59.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.18,0:10:01.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.45,0:10:07.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.11,0:10:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me a hand?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You oughta be\Nashamed of yourself,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.05,0:10:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,using a line like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.62,0:10:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what was that about\Nfour legs being useless?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.66,0:10:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just needed to catch you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:31.62,0:10:33.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't run now!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.96,0:10:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hate you, you jerk!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.03,0:10:38.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just want to be me!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.80,0:10:40.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me my individuality back!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.75,0:10:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right on the other side\Nof that door behind you,
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.92,0:10:45.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,my friend is waiting\Nto be rescued.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.75,0:10:52.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I say no, I mean no!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.02,0:10:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Kenpo Secret\NMove Poison Pasta Cutter!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.39,0:10:58.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Touch it and die!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:59.19,0:11:01.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.30,0:11:02.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You people are pathetic!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.88,0:11:05.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin has you eating right out of her\Nhand!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.82,0:11:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's betrayed every\Nperson she's ever met,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.92,0:11:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and you're here risking\Nyour life to save her?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.02,0:11:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're beyond help!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.42,0:11:13.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Three-Spot Decoupage.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.89,0:12:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hiss! I didn't think\Nyou'd use such a dumb trick!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.96,0:12:11.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I let my guard down!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.46,0:12:12.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.73,0:12:16.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, cause I'm\Nthe dumb one here.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.14,0:12:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Instead of making excuses\Nwhy don't you tell me
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.90,0:12:27.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what you want written on\Nyour gravestone, brother.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.34,0:12:30.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.94,0:12:33.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't think this fight is over yet,\Ndo you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.58,0:12:35.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.29,0:12:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since you dodged all\Nmy punches so far,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.63,0:12:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't really blame you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.33,0:12:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have no clue\Nhow hard I can hit.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.97,0:12:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be a nasty surprise!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.27,0:12:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Here's my Ultimate Hammer!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.45,0:13:32.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, some entrance.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.88,0:13:34.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell have you been doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.52,0:13:35.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.75,0:13:38.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well as per usual, I've been\Nkicking ass and what about you?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.69,0:13:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Been kicking ass.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.44,0:13:47.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gotten so noisy all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.68,0:13:49.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I take it all of the escorts
Dialogue: 50,0:13:49.12,0:13:51.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for this mission have\Nbeen annihilated then?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.35,0:13:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we weren't expecting much
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.45,0:13:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,from them to begin with.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.66,0:13:58.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So it's you, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.22,0:14:00.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the bastards who kidnapped Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.49,0:14:01.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.69,0:14:03.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They use some\Npretty weird moves.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.83,0:14:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And who is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.02,0:14:11.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Based on what Corgy said,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.35,0:14:13.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he's probably that\Nnew recruit for CP9.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.72,0:14:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Name's Nero, he's\Ngone through training,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.02,0:14:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,knows four of the powers.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.90,0:14:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in for it now, you bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.97,0:14:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody does that to me and gets away with\Nit!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.54,0:14:30.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll show you why they call me the genius\Nof fighting!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.80,0:14:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now prepare to die!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.68,0:14:34.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Huh?\N– Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.40,0:14:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey new guy.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.72,0:14:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me guess,\Nyou must be Rob Lucci.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.32,0:14:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry I didn't introduce myself.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.72,0:14:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just give me a moment and I'll kill this\Ntroublemaker.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.51,0:14:48.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our orders were to bring him in alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.81,0:14:52.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've let your emotions get the better of\Nyou, it seems.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.45,0:14:54.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, that just won't do.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.86,0:14:59.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give you three seconds to run for\Nyour life.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.80,0:15:00.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.84,0:15:02.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run for my life?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run from who?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.27,0:15:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.52,0:15:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop kidding around, okay?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:06.84,0:15:08.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not funny!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.47,0:15:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And one.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.24,0:15:12.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Don't do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.21,0:15:32.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're nothing more than an incompetent\Npiece of trash.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.91,0:15:34.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You call yourself CP9?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.95,0:15:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.97,0:15:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have to master all Six\NPowers to be one of us, rookie.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.74,0:15:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.41,0:15:47.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.61,0:15:51.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On our official report, state:\N"The new guy was too weak.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.88,0:15:54.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was therefore\Ndeemed worthless."
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.08,0:15:55.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.83,0:16:00.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And these are the\Nagents of justice?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.31,0:16:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't tell which\Nside is evil, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.71,0:16:07.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose there's no need to ask
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.14,0:16:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what you're doing on\Nthis train, intruder.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.74,0:16:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Judging by the way\Nyou opened the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.35,0:16:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know exactly the kind
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.65,0:16:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of impatient people\Nwe're dealing with.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.65,0:16:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:17.58,0:16:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess you'll have to excuse my manners.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.05,0:16:22.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've come to rescue Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.56,0:16:24.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.57,0:16:25.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.70,0:16:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her problem is one that's\Nbeyond your comprehension.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.47,0:16:30.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You see, there are\Nsome people in this world
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.01,0:16:33.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who were just born\Nunder a bad sign.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.41,0:16:37.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,People who are, for the sake of everyone\Nelse, better off dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:39.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For example.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.99,0:16:42.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suppose there exists\Na sleeping devil.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.30,0:16:49.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One that's capable of burning the entire\Nworld to the ground.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.20,0:16:50.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what if there was someone
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.70,0:16:52.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with the ability\Nto wake that devil?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.44,0:16:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if this someone happened to be an\Neight-year-old girl.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.30,0:16:58.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you think\Nthat for the lives
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.78,0:17:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,of every other living\Nbeing on this planet,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.85,0:17:03.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that girl should be put to death?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.69,0:17:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop rambling and get to the point.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.53,0:17:09.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What I just told you is the true story of\NNico Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.83,0:17:11.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her very first transgression.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.67,0:17:15.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now, she's accumulated\Nan entire life of crime.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As far back as she can remember,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.02,0:17:20.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,her very existence has\Nbeen nothing but a sin.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.41,0:17:22.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only good she can\Ndo this world would be
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.74,0:17:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to forfeit her life\Nand disappear forever.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.51,0:17:27.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the misfortune she carries with\Nher.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.86,0:17:28.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's cursed.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.98,0:17:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She has no choice but to accept her fate\Nand die.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.91,0:17:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Honestly, she should've\Ndied over twenty years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.88,0:17:39.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're merely correcting a wrong from the\Npast.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.70,0:17:42.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It'll be better\Nfor everyone else
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.59,0:17:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,when this is over\Nand she's dead.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.19,0:17:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:51.54,0:17:53.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.41,0:17:56.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hear\Nanother word out of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.24,0:17:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pity.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:56.96,0:18:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her death won't come nearly as quickly as\NI would like.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.81,0:18:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Interrogations.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.98,0:18:06.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Torture.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.84,0:18:07.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Slowly.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.81,0:18:09.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Repeatedly.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:09.04,0:18:11.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The World Government is going\Nto keep her alive for years,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.68,0:18:13.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,squeezing out all\Nof her knowledge,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.74,0:18:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,experiences,\Nand intelligence.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.78,0:18:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She'll know agony\Nbefore she dies.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.95,0:18:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let that happen!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.96,0:18:20.02,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! Robin! Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.06,0:18:21.86,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't go in there!\NNo! Seriously!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.89,0:18:26.90,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a really, really,\Nreally bad idea! Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.93,0:18:30.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I said "Wait!"\Nnot "Keep going!"
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.27,0:18:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.28,0:18:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.78,0:18:34.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're in deep trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.15,0:18:35.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.05,0:18:35.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.02,0:18:36.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.02,0:18:38.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you doing this?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.04,0:18:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I went through all that trouble to sneak\Nin from the outside!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.29,0:18:43.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I even took out that snoopy government\Nguy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.23,0:18:47.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that's Nico Robin, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd buy that.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.57,0:18:53.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like the girl in the\Nwanted poster, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.15,0:18:56.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme knock these guys\Nout then we'll escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.79,0:19:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll run away together and\Nleave all this behind us! 'Kay?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.06,0:19:02.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be all right!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.71,0:19:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.10,0:19:13.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.15,0:19:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems that my words mean nothing to you\Npeople.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.16,0:19:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky! Quick!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.57,0:19:40.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Detach the third car!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.45,0:19:42.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why? What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.73,0:19:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.15,0:19:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna run?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:45.02,0:19:46.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you talking about?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.72,0:19:48.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You too, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.05,0:19:48.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.75,0:19:50.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will be over in a flash!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.86,0:19:52.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure that Franky doesn't escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:52.72,0:19:55.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.76,0:20:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,192)}Sniper King Smoke Star!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.96,0:20:10.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What kind of a\Nstupid stunt is that?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.50,0:20:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.81,0:20:15.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got her!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.74,0:20:17.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.55,0:20:20.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.88,0:20:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.98,0:20:28.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– All right!\N– All right!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.46,0:20:30.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.39,0:20:41.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn back!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.89,0:20:43.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we've already come so far!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.65,0:20:44.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer us!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.95,0:20:46.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Yeah, tell us why!\N– Yeah, tell us why!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.38,0:20:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You better give us a reason!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.25,0:20:51.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.99,0:20:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was telling that\Ngiant frog that jumped
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:55.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on the railway to turn back!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.86,0:20:58.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He came out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.89,0:21:00.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero! Gero! Gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.21,0:21:01.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Yokozuna!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.81,0:21:03.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.21,0:21:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(0,59)}– No way!\N– No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.79,0:21:04.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,59)}Look out!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.72,0:21:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,59)}A giant frog's on the tracks!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.64,0:21:08.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Froggy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.25,0:21:09.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn back!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.31,0:21:10.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gero!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.70,0:21:12.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3692,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Look out!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.20,0:21:16.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.53,0:21:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.70,0:21:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got Robin back!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.03,0:21:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know I should be happy.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.00,0:21:29.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm not really a big fan\Nof this "running away" stuff.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.07,0:21:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That smoke screen\Nwas such a stupid idea
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.30,0:21:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that it actually surprised them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.01,0:21:35.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whew!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.01,0:21:38.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sniper King says,\N"The plan that involves us
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.45,0:21:41.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,not fighting scary guys like\Nthem is the best plan of all."
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.86,0:21:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doubtful.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.47,0:21:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, that was too easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.54,0:21:47.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.58,0:21:49.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These guys aren't like the others.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.12,0:21:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't let our guard down just yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.99,0:21:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.13,0:22:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those thorny whips again?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.20,0:22:06.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got them.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.49,0:22:07.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, Blueno.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.64,0:22:08.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.94,0:22:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick! Cut those things!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.57,0:22:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're pulling us back!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.65,0:22:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, these guys are powerful!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.26,0:22:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you actually think a smoke screen\Nwould stop us?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.06,0:22:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, that was way too easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.13,0:22:41.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now remember, don't kill any of the Straw\NHats.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.57,0:22:44.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was our agreement.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.21,0:22:45.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sniper King.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.14,0:22:45.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.93,0:22:47.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect Robin with your life!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.48,0:22:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.32,0:22:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.80,0:22:49.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.70,0:22:54.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to ask you to let our car\Ngo!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.97,0:22:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.24,0:23:00.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His body's like a rock!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.96,0:23:04.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, these guys\Nuse some weird moves!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.58,0:23:13.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Concassé!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.52,0:23:24.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that was a pretty powerful kick.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.96,0:23:27.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It almost broke\Nthrough the Iron Body.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.16,0:23:28.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Careful, Blueno.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.16,0:23:29.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't take him lightly.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.49,0:23:31.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He doesn't have a bounty on him,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.20,0:23:33.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he's one of\Ntheir main fighters.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.41,0:23:35.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Robin!\NHold on a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.27,0:23:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.65,0:23:40.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Now Ocho Fleurs!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.61,0:23:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}With a Clutch!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.73,0:23:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long nose! Look out!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.70,0:23:50.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Robin, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.16,0:23:54.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.43,0:23:55.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay out of my business!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.55,0:23:56.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.46,0:24:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.47,0:24:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Buddy! You\Nshould learn to pay attention.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.60,0:24:15.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyebrows!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:18.46,0:24:19.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You Straw Hats are nuts!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.80,0:24:21.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of you make any damn sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.40,0:24:22.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of you are so stubborn,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.53,0:24:25.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,especially when it has anything\Nto do with your friends!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.57,0:24:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we've come this far.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:27.44,0:24:29.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, you want to escape, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.57,0:24:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then here's your big chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.08,0:25:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.43,0:25:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was uncalled for.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.13,0:25:22.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect that, did ya?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:22.57,0:25:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't understand your intentions.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.50,0:25:26.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why side with them in the first place?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.97,0:25:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I couldn't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:28.73,0:25:29.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what she said or did,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.89,0:25:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,those two idiots weren't\Ngonna leave here without her.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.32,0:25:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That still doesn't explain why you're\Nbutting in on this.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.15,0:25:36.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.72,0:25:38.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.19,0:25:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get outta here!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.82,0:25:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.09,0:25:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.29,0:25:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you meet up with Straw Hat,
Dialogue: 50,0:25:42.26,0:25:45.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,find some way to get\Nback to Water Seven, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.53,0:25:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.33,0:25:47.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.23,0:25:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not trying to escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.33,0:25:49.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't run!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.18,0:25:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, what's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.68,0:25:53.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.72,0:25:55.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no point in\Ntrying to pretend anymore!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.82,0:25:57.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We know, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.49,0:26:02.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We know what you did and\Nwe came here to rescue you!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:02.15,0:26:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if they
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.09,0:26:05.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Buster Call" us to\Nthe ends of the world,
Dialogue: 50,0:26:05.29,0:26:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we'll fight them and win!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.69,0:26:08.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no reason for\Nyou to keep obeying them
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.72,0:26:11.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and throw your life away!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.57,0:26:17.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.63,0:26:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there's a Buster Call.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.21,0:26:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be obliterated.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.38,0:26:36.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tempest Kick!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.52,0:26:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.62,0:26:46.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.23,0:26:47.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He came outta nowhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.69,0:26:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did he do that?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.42,0:26:54.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.12,0:26:55.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blueno disappeared?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.58,0:26:57.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing of the sort.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.62,0:26:59.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the power of\Nhis Door-Door Fruit.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.92,0:27:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can create a\Ndoor out of thin air
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.39,0:27:05.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then use it to travel\Nto another location.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.70,0:27:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, don't bother trying to\Nescape.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.74,0:27:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's simply not possible.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.42,0:27:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let Robin go.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.89,0:27:33.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Finger Pistol.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.89,0:27:41.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.03,0:27:43.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Iron Body.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.79,0:27:47.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your last kick was a lot stronger.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.07,0:27:49.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tired already?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:04.94,0:28:06.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stubborn one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.79,0:28:08.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.99,0:28:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I promise, I have no intention of running\Naway.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.72,0:28:15.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll honor the deal-you\Ndon't have to hurt them.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.62,0:28:18.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who keep attacking me.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.50,0:28:20.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you expect?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:20.47,0:28:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then let's hurry and leave before they get\Nup again.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:26.94,0:28:28.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.97,0:28:35.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.70,0:28:38.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:38.37,0:28:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.12,0:28:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're still hiding something from us,\Naren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.31,0:28:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But there's one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.43,0:28:55.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do what you want.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:56.71,0:29:02.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But a pirate isn't\Nallowed to leave their crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.40,0:29:06.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless they have their\Ncaptain's permission.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:08.81,0:29:11.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So no matter what.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.41,0:29:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can always believe in Luffy.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.19,0:29:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin, don't go!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.16,0:29:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can say what\Nyou like to her,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:38.46,0:29:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but she won't\Nbreak our agreement.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.73,0:29:42.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.00,0:29:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long ago an island was erased.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.97,0:29:51.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is to say, the\NNavy issued a Buster Call
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.17,0:29:52.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and burned it to the ground
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.94,0:29:55.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,without leaving a\Nsingle trace behind.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.07,0:29:57.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The only survivor\Nof that incident
Dialogue: 50,0:29:57.81,0:30:01.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,was Nico Robin,\Nstill a child at the time.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:01.45,0:30:03.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She never told us.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.32,0:30:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Five vice admirals\Nand ten battleships
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.16,0:30:08.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,are a terrifying force\Nfor anyone to behold.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:08.93,0:30:12.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But for a child to see\Nthem destroy her home.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:12.13,0:30:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, it's nothing short of a nightmare.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:15.42,0:30:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those thoughts have\Nhaunted her for years
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.31,0:30:20.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and now that her old\Nnightmare bares its fangs
Dialogue: 50,0:30:21.34,0:30:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,at her companions she no longer\Nhas the will to resist us.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.05,0:30:30.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bastards,\Nyou knew and you used that.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.02,0:30:37.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course we did.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.13,0:30:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is sick.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.30,0:30:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You people are sick,\Nyou hear me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:42.67,0:30:45.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of this is for the sake of justice.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.37,0:30:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I sympathize with her, but I cannot be\Nswayed.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.74,0:30:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that crap!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.66,0:31:14.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This isn't over!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:16.87,0:31:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Enies Lobby Department\Nof Management here.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:19.71,0:31:21.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is everything in order regarding the\Ntransfer?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:22.01,0:31:23.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:23.14,0:31:26.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We will be delivering the two criminals on\Nschedule.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.32,0:31:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can see the island now, so expect us\Nsoon.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:30.72,0:31:31.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Understood.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.79,0:31:34.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll make preparations for your return.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.73,0:31:37.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help but\Nfeel a bit nostalgic
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.87,0:31:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,after five years of absence.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:40.57,0:31:42.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Nightless Island, Enies Lobby.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=3}===============================DIALOGUE============================
